Phase 4: Candidate Pipeline Kanban — first real recruiter UI

Frontend (apps/web):
- @dnd-kit/core + @dnd-kit/sortable + clsx added as dependencies
- src/lib/api/
    types.ts       TypeScript mirrors of Pydantic schemas
                   (Candidate, Campaign, LeadSource + PIPELINE_STAGES const)
    client.ts      typed fetch wrapper with ApiError class; reads
                   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL; query/method/body helpers
    candidates.ts  candidates.{list,get,create,update,setPipelineStage,remove}
    index.ts       barrel export
- src/components/pipeline/
    CandidateCard.tsx          one card, color-coded fit-score badge
    KanbanColumn.tsx           one stage column; droppable; nested Draggable
    KanbanBoard.tsx            top-level: DndContext, optimistic state mgmt
                               with rollback-on-error; integrated detail panel
    CandidateDetailPanel.tsx   slide-out right panel, stage selector,
                               vetting-language reminder per spec hard rule,
                               delete with confirm
- src/app/[locale]/candidates/page.tsx
    Server-rendered initial fetch via apiRequest with graceful "backend
    unreachable" fallback when uvicorn isn't running
- src/app/[locale]/page.tsx
    Home page CTA: "Open the candidate pipeline" → /candidates
- messages/{fr,en}.json
    +29 new keys: pipeline.title, pipeline.stages.*, pipeline.detail.*,
    common.{close,retry,no_data,actions}, vetting_reminder
    Plural-aware: pipeline.total_candidates uses ICU plural formatting

Backend (apps/api):
- scripts/seed_dev_candidates.py
    12 fictional candidates seeded into Railway, spread across all 9
    pipeline stages, realistic Quebec recruiting profiles
    (frigoristes, apprentis, finissants, regions Mtl/QC/Laval/Sherbrooke/etc.)
    Idempotent — uses email-based upsert
- Schema split: Create uses EmailStr/HttpUrl for input validation,
  Read uses plain str so stored data (incl. .test TLDs) doesn't crash
  response serialization. Lesson: validate on input, not on output.

Tests: 10/10 still passing.
Build: 7/7 static + dynamic /[locale]/candidates route.

Hard rules honored:
- pipeline.detail vetting reminder shown in both languages
  ("le score est consultatif. Le recruteur valide les certifications
   avant toute décision.")
- Delete requires confirm dialog
- All UI strings via translation keys (FR default)

Designed by CTRL Solutions.
